@baseUrl = https://localhost:7150
@antiforgeryCookie = replace-with-cookie-from-login-page
@antiforgeryToken = replace-with-hidden-form-token-from-login-page

### Get the page and its language form (requires a configured application database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/login

### Explicit German selection; returns a local redirect and sets only the UI cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui/language
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Cookie: {{antiforgeryCookie}}

Culture=de-DE&ReturnUrl=%2Flogin&__RequestVerificationToken={{antiforgeryToken}}

### Invalid culture: 400, no language cookie written
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui/language
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Cookie: {{antiforgeryCookie}}

Culture=fr-FR&ReturnUrl=%2Flogin&__RequestVerificationToken={{antiforgeryToken}}

### Missing antiforgery token: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui/language
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Culture=en-US&ReturnUrl=%2Flogin
